                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip1:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 溺尸" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="溺尸的呻吟声是音效师Samuel Åberg用牛奶漱喉的声音。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. Minecraft: The Wild Update (Original Game Soundtrack)" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="曲目“Ancestry”虽然也于22w16a或基岩版1.19.0.26与本专辑其他歌曲一同加入，但包含在专辑Minecraft: Caves &amp; Cliffs (Original Game Soundtrack)中，而非本专辑。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 铁栏杆" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="铁栏杆和床都可以加速僵尸村民的治愈，而这两种方块都常见于牢房。" />
                        <StackPanel Orientation="Horizontal" Margin="0,2,0,0" HorizontalAlignment="Left">
